* Register delay defaults and explicit qualifiers, fine-resolution timing
Vd d 0 PWL(0 0 1n 0 1.1n 5 8n 5 8.1n 0 16n 0)
Vc ck 0 PWL(0 0 2n 0 2.1n 5 4n 5 4.1n 0 10n 0 10.1n 5 12n 5 12.1n 0 16n 0)
.model M0 d_logic_block file=L0 family="HC" input_load=0 out_res=0 out_delay=1n reg_delay=-1n
